              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthamaki ũcio nĩaheaga Jehoiakini indo cia kũmũteithia cia o mũthenya, matukũ mothe marĩa aatũũrire muoyo.",
